  "description": "Archived validation cases whose outcome against the current shapes differs from the one their snapshot recorded, each under the change that caused it. Snapshots are immutable and their cases are not edited; python tools/test_release_contract.py --replay-history replays every snapshot's cases against its own shapes (all must hold) and against the current ones, and fails on a divergence this file does not list and on a listed one that no longer occurs. cases maps a corpus or contract file to case names, each with the snapshots whose copy of the case diverges.",
